{"seq":3,"slug":"training-infrastructure","title":"训练基础设施：千卡集群的分布式训练工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/engineering/training-infrastructure","wordCount":1399,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"训练基础设施-千卡集群的分布式训练工程\">训练基础设施：千卡集群的分布式训练工程</h1><p>训练一个 400B+ 参数的 MoE 模型需要数千块 GPU 协同工作数周到数月。单块 GPU 只有 80-192 GB 显存，无法容纳整个模型——更不用说训练过程中的梯度、优化器状态和激活值。分布式训练基础设施解决的核心问题是：如何将一个超出单设备能力的训练任务高效、稳定地分配到数千设备上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分布式训练的基本策略是将模型和数据在多个维度上切分，每个维度对应一种并行方式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PARALLEL[分布式并行策略] --&gt; DP[数据并行 Data Parallelism]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; TP[张量并行 Tensor Parallelism]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; PP[流水线并行 Pipeline Parallelism]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; EP[专家并行 Expert Parallelism]&#10;    PARALLEL --&gt; CP[上下文并行 Context Parallelism]&#10;    DP --&gt; FSDP[ZeRO/FSDP: 参数分片]&#10;    TP --&gt; INTRA[节点内: 高带宽 NVLink]&#10;    PP --&gt; INTER[节点间: InfiniBand]&#10;    EP --&gt; A2A[All-to-All 通信]&#10;    CP --&gt; RING[Ring Attention]\">graph TD\n    PARALLEL[分布式并行策略] --&gt; DP[数据并行 Data Parallelism]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; TP[张量并行 Tensor Parallelism]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; PP[流水线并行 Pipeline Parallelism]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; EP[专家并行 Expert Parallelism]\n    PARALLEL --&gt; CP[上下文并行 Context Parallelism]\n    DP --&gt; FSDP[ZeRO/FSDP: 参数分片]\n    TP --&gt; INTRA[节点内: 高带宽 NVLink]\n    PP --&gt; INTER[节点间: InfiniBand]\n    EP --&gt; A2A[All-to-All 通信]\n    CP --&gt; RING[Ring Attention]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并行策略</th>\n<th>切分对象</th>\n<th>通信模式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>通信量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据并行（DP）</td>\n<td>训练数据 batch</td>\n<td>AllReduce 梯度</td>\n<td>参数能放入单卡</td>\n<td>$O(</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeRO/FSDP</td>\n<td>参数+梯度+状态</td>\n<td>AllGather + ReduceScatter</td>\n<td>超大模型</td>\n<td>$O(</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>张量并行（TP）</td>\n<td>单层的权重矩阵</td>\n<td>AllReduce 激活值</td>\n<td>节点内（高带宽）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线并行（PP）</td>\n<td>模型的不同层</td>\n<td>P2P 激活值传递</td>\n<td>节点间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> per stage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家并行（EP）</td>\n<td>MoE 的不同专家</td>\n<td>All-to-All token 路由</td>\n<td>MoE 模型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot d \\cdot k/E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文并行（CP）</td>\n<td>序列长度</td>\n<td>Ring 传递 KV</td>\n<td>超长上下文训练</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"张量并行-节点内的矩阵切分\">张量并行：节点内的矩阵切分</h2><p>张量并行将单个矩阵运算切分到多块 GPU 上并行计算。以线性层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = XW</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为例：</p>\n<p><strong>列切分</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 按列切分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[W_1, W_2, \\ldots, W_k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，每块 GPU 算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i = XW_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，拼接后得到完整输出。</p>\n<p><strong>行切分</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 按行切分，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 对应地按列切分，每块 GPU 算局部结果后 AllReduce 求和。</p>\n<p>Transformer 的注意力层和 FFN 层的切分策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 注意力层的 TP 切分（Megatron-LM 风格）&#10;# Q, K, V 投影按列切分（每 GPU 负责部分注意力头）&#10;# 输出投影按行切分&#10;# 两次矩阵乘之间只需一次 AllReduce&#10;&#10;# FFN 层的 TP 切分&#10;# 第一层（up projection）按列切分&#10;# 第二层（down projection）按行切分&#10;# 同样只需一次 AllReduce\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 注意力层的 TP 切分（Megatron-LM 风格）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Q, K, V 投影按列切分（每 GPU 负责部分注意力头）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出投影按行切分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 两次矩阵乘之间只需一次 AllReduce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># FFN 层的 TP 切分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 第一层（up projection）按列切分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 第二层（down projection）按行切分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同样只需一次 AllReduce</span></span></code></pre></div><p>张量并行要求 GPU 间有极高带宽（NVLink: 900 GB/s），因此通常限制在单节点的 8 块 GPU 内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流水线并行与-micro-batch-调度\">流水线并行与 Micro-batch 调度</h2><p>流水线并行将模型的不同层分配到不同 GPU（Stage），数据像流水线一样依次经过每个 Stage。核心挑战是<strong>流水线气泡</strong>（Pipeline Bubble）——前几个 Stage 计算时后面的 Stage 空闲，最后几个 Stage 计算时前面的空闲。</p>\n<p><strong>1F1B 调度</strong>：将 mini-batch 拆成多个 micro-batch，交错安排前向和反向传播，最小化气泡比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>气泡比例</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{气泡比例} = \\frac{p - 1}{m + p - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">气泡比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为 Stage 数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为 micro-batch 数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 越大气泡越小，但内存占用（缓存激活值）越大。</p>\n<p><strong>ZeroBubble（2025-2026 进展）</strong>：通过重新排列计算顺序和引入&quot;虚拟 Stage&quot;，将气泡比例从理论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(p-1)/(m+p-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降低到接近零——代价是实现复杂度更高、需要更精细的内存管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专家并行-moe-的通信挑战\">专家并行：MoE 的通信挑战</h2><p>MoE 模型的 Expert Parallelism 将不同专家放在不同 GPU 上。每个 token 经路由后需要被发送到持有对应专家的 GPU——这产生 All-to-All 通信模式：</p>\n<p><strong>问题</strong>：All-to-All 通信量取决于路由决策的负载均衡程度。如果某个 GPU 上的专家被过度路由，该 GPU 成为通信和计算的双重瓶颈。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>辅助损失或动态偏置确保负载均衡（见 MoE 章节）</li>\n<li>Capacity Factor 限制每个专家处理的最大 token 数</li>\n<li>Overlapping：计算与通信重叠（当一批 token 做 FFN 时，下一批在通信中）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DeepSeek V3 的训练使用了 DP + TP + EP 的三维并行，在 2000+ H800 上实现了接近线性的扩展效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练稳定性与容错\">训练稳定性与容错</h2><p>千卡级训练面临的非算法挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题类型</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬件故障（GPU/网络）</td>\n<td>每天数次</td>\n<td>训练中断</td>\n<td>自动检查点 + 故障节点替换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loss Spike</td>\n<td>不定期</td>\n<td>训练不稳定</td>\n<td>降学习率 / 跳过异常 batch / 回退检查点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度溢出/下溢</td>\n<td>训练早期</td>\n<td>NaN 扩散</td>\n<td>混合精度 + Loss Scaling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信卡死</td>\n<td>偶发</td>\n<td>所有节点阻塞</td>\n<td>Heartbeat 超时检测 + 自动重启</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>检查点策略</strong>：每 N 步保存完整模型状态（参数+优化器+RNG 状态+数据 loader 位置），支持从任意检查点恢复。异步检查点（将保存操作推到后台）避免阻塞训练。</p>\n<p><strong>混合精度训练</strong>：参数维护 FP32 主副本用于精确梯度累积，前向/反向计算使用 BF16 加速，动态 Loss Scaling 防止梯度下溢：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>scaled_loss</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>loss</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>grad</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>scaled_grad</mtext><mi>s</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{scaled\\_loss} = \\text{loss} \\times s, \\quad \\text{grad} = \\frac{\\text{scaled\\_grad}}{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scaled_loss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grad</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0804em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scaled_grad</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"2026-年的训练基础设施生态\">2026 年的训练基础设施生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架/工具</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>关键特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Megatron-LM</td>\n<td>NVIDIA 官方</td>\n<td>完整 N-D 并行，生产级稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSpeed</td>\n<td>微软</td>\n<td>ZeRO 系列，通信优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NeMo Framework</td>\n<td>NVIDIA</td>\n<td>Megatron + NeMo 整合，支持 CP 128K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PyTorch FSDP2</td>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td>原生 PyTorch，易用性优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colossal-AI</td>\n<td>社区</td>\n<td>异构并行，自动策略搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式训练的本质是在多个维度上切分模型/数据/序列，各策略适用于不同通信条件</li>\n<li>张量并行用于节点内（高带宽），流水线并行用于节点间（高延迟可容忍）</li>\n<li>MoE 的 Expert Parallelism 引入 All-to-All 通信，负载均衡是其关键挑战</li>\n<li>训练稳定性（容错、检查点、Loss Spike 处理）在千卡规模下比算法设计同等重要</li>\n<li>2026 年的训练运行本身就是一项复杂的分布式系统工程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前一篇 <a href=\"inference-optimization\">推理优化</a>讨论训练完成后的模型如何高效服务</li>\n<li>预训练篇 <a href=\"../pretraining/mixture-of-experts\">混合专家模型</a>解释 Expert Parallelism 的架构动机</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../graph-neural-networks/engineering/scalable-gnn-training\">GNN 中的可扩展训练</a>展示图数据的分布式训练有何不同的挑战（不规则通信模式）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"训练基础设施：千卡集群的分布式训练工程","id":"训练基础设施-千卡集群的分布式训练工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"张量并行：节点内的矩阵切分","id":"张量并行-节点内的矩阵切分"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线并行与 Micro-batch 调度","id":"流水线并行与-micro-batch-调度"},{"level":2,"text":"专家并行：MoE 的通信挑战","id":"专家并行-moe-的通信挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"训练稳定性与容错","id":"训练稳定性与容错"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的训练基础设施生态","id":"2026-年的训练基础设施生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"推理优化：让大模型在成本约束下服务用户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/engineering/inference-optimization"},"next":null}